{"abstract":"According to the provisions of section 10 of the Federal Advisory Committee Act, notice is hereby given that a virtual meeting of the Federal Prevailing Rate Advisory Committee will be held on Thursday, April 21, 2022. There will be no in-person gathering for this meeting. The Federal Prevailing Rate Advisory Committee is composed of a Chair, five representatives from labor unions holding exclusive bargaining rights for Federal prevailing rate employees, and five representatives from Federal agencies. The Committee's primary responsibility is to review the Prevailing Rate System and other matters pertinent to establishing prevailing rates and from time to time advise the Office of Personnel Management.","action":"Notice.","agencies":[{"id":406,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/406","name":"Personnel Management Office","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"OFFICE OF PERSONNEL MANAGEMENT","slug":"personnel-management-office","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/personnel-management-office"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06869.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19143","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"The virtual meeting will be held on April 21, 2022, beginning at 10:00 a.m. (EST).","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[{"agency_name":"OPM","documents":[{"allow_late_comments":false,"comment_count":0,"comment_end_date":null,"comment_start_date":"2022-04-01","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/OPM-2025-0009-0012","id":"OPM-2025-0009-0012","regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false,"updated_at":"2025-05-23T16:58:51.670-04:00"}],"id":"OPM-2025-0009","supporting_documents":[],"supporting_documents_count":0,"title":"Meetings: Federal Prevailing Rate Advisory Committee (2020-2025)"}],"document_number":"2022-06869","effective_on":null,"end_page":19144,"executive_order_notes":nul